00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:16.000
God, we come before you tonight with words that fail,

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:22.000
but hearts and bodies that are present to you, God.

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:26.000
God, we stand on the truth of your promises,

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:29.000
that you are the source of hope,

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:32.000
the source of peace that surpasses understanding,

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:38.000
the source of comfort in our grief and anger and rage.

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:45.000
And God, we remember that we are all connected,

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:48.000
that we all are part of your kingdom,

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:51.000
so we lift each other up.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:54.000
We hurt together, we lift each other up together,

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:58.000
we love one another with all that we have.

00:10:58.000 --> 00:11:03.000
So God, help us to be anchored in your hope,

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:07.000
to have faith for what is yet unseen,

00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:11.000
to live in and lean into your promises

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:14.000
that all will be free,

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:18.000
that every tear will be wiped.

00:11:18.000 --> 00:11:21.000
God, thank you that through it all,

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:24.000
you are still faithful and you are still good.

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:26.000
And we thank you for that.

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:29.000
In Jesus' name. Amen.

