00:34:17.000 --> 00:34:19.000
or just for various reasons.

00:34:19.000 --> 00:34:22.000
I mean, I'm in touch with many of you via text throughout the week

00:34:22.000 --> 00:34:25.000
and I know there's just so many battles and so many struggles.

00:34:25.000 --> 00:34:28.000
You know, like life is often a lot of pain.

00:34:28.000 --> 00:34:30.000
That's life.

00:34:30.000 --> 00:34:36.000
And so I think there's something so beautiful

00:34:36.000 --> 00:34:39.000
about coming together in the midst of it, right?

00:34:39.000 --> 00:34:44.000
Instead of finding that kind of lamenting and suffering and pain

00:34:44.000 --> 00:34:48.000
kind of driving us, like the temptation is that it drives us into isolation.

00:34:48.000 --> 00:34:51.000
You know, it's like we start getting in that depressed state,

00:34:51.000 --> 00:34:54.000
even though we know what we need is like connection,

00:34:54.000 --> 00:34:56.000
but boy, we're not feeling it.

00:34:56.000 --> 00:34:58.000
